<speak>I am leaning towards using the digital inbox as the main reference point, although I am not ready to throw away every paper habit. For reading at leisure, paper is still comfortable. For finding something quickly, digital ought to be better if I remember how to get there. I do not want duplicate piles just because I have not decided which one to use. Let us keep this as a preference for now, and I can deal with any formal administrative steps separately. I would rather not rush through a change while we are talking about several different things. That is when I usually miss a detail.</speak>